OL,3,ADavey says Lib Dems would cut income
OL,4,Atax and grow economy by rejoining EU
OL,5,Asingle market
OL,6,
OL,7,FLiberal Democrat leader Ed Davey says
OL,8,Fhis party wants to cut income tax, in a
OL,9,Fspeech to close his party's annual
OL,10,Fconference - here's what else we heard
OL,12,FHe says, if in power, his party would
OL,13,Fraise the tax-free personal allowance
OL,14,Fto #15,000 and the higher rate 40% tax
OL,15,Fband threshold to #56,000
OL,17,FDavey says this would be funded by
OL,18,Fgrowing the economy through closer ties
OL,19,Fwith Europe, including rejoining the EU
OL,20,Fsingle market - BBC Verify crunches the
OL,21,Fnumbers
